{"id":"npc:%E5%A1%9E%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"普通海盗。核心任务是跟随水手长鲁斯进行盐层勘探和资源打捞工作。在一次勘探任务中，他负责监督伊西多，却意外遭遇盐层塌陷事故。伊西多救了他，但他因此失去了左腿。重伤康复期间他对伊西多的态度发生转变，表达了感激，并认为伊西多具有“天生的海盗”特质。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情EP-2 腿部拆卸疗法、EP-3 大出血的舞步等"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1591_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1591_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_1591_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_st01","lineCount":14,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":271,"line":272,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"该清醒的是你们！"},{"commandIndex":297,"line":298,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"这么多年你对那疯婆娘百依百顺，她说的一切你都支持。"},{"commandIndex":340,"line":341,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"咳……咳咳咳——！"}]},{"story":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_02_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":581,"line":582,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"传令！准备开挖！"}]},{"story":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_02_end","lineCount":35,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":22,"line":23,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"你知道这是什么？"},{"commandIndex":147,"line":148,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"疯婆娘很喜欢它们，曾经想过捕捉到船上来饲养，但这种盐鳞一旦离群就会迅速失去活力，所以她最终还是放弃了。"},{"commandIndex":535,"line":536,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"唔……唔……"}]},{"story":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_03_end","lineCount":14,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":647,"line":648,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"你笑起来……挺难看。"},{"commandIndex":694,"line":695,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"你没家……四处流浪，不喜欢安逸……常与危险……咳咳……动荡为伍。你简直……"},{"commandIndex":696,"line":697,"speaker":"塞斯克","text":"……"}]}]}